(7595327, 1225442, 87808, '<td valign="top">The top light line, for me, does nothing to improve this photo.  I wish you had cropped it out. Cropped out, I would have scored a 9, as it is crisp and clean, the tree''s are amazing, some stars, so infinity,. For me, personally, that line kills it, I am so sorry, a 6,</td>', 'The top light line, for me, does nothing to improve this photo.  I wish you had cropped it out. Cropped out, I would have scored a 9, as it is crisp and clean, the tree''s are amazing, some stars, so infinity,. For me, personally, that line kills it, I am so sorry, a 6,', '2018-09-07 00:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
