(7595465, 1224995, 194290, '<td valign="top">Thats a great image. how long is the shutter speed?</td>', 'Thats a great image. how long is the shutter speed?', '2018-09-08 10:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7595466, 1225345, 194290, '<td valign="top">This is really an awesome entry and glad it got the red. most often light streaks means people come up with light trails or light paining, here you got the natural rays from the sky. Congratulations</td>', 'This is really an awesome entry and glad it got the red. most often light streaks means people come up with light trails or light paining, here you got the natural rays from the sky. Congratulations', '2018-09-08 10:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7595491, 1224995, 163081, '<td valign="top">This was very difficult to take with the mixed lanes. In the Canon 70D I can select multiple exposures and adjust the layering intensity in camera. Biggest problem is to get it dark enough to have 4 exposures of about 25 seconds each. Using good ND filters is a must with this type of shots. Also, after 4 exposures the first one risks to simply vanish. Good thing is that the light streaks were very bright in contrast with the background.<br/></td>', 'This was very difficult to take with the mixed lanes. In the Canon 70D I can select multiple exposures and adjust the layering intensity in camera. Biggest problem is to get it dark enough to have 4 exposures of about 25 seconds each. Using good ND filters is a must with this type of shots. Also, after 4 exposures the first one risks to simply vanish. Good thing is that the light streaks were very bright in contrast with the background.', '2018-09-08 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7595612, 1225345, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!</td>', 'This is so beautiful!', '2018-09-09 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 0);
